{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlJTIwRGVjZWl2ZXJzJTIwJTI4MTk4OCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Deceivers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dwno7eKJbzNZ2prc5wI1istvnyj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tRyR9eI9yTJ3eOgjIUyHVpBzk9f.jpg","description":"India, 1825: the country lives in mortal fear of cult members known as the “Deceivers.\" They commit robbery and ritualistic murder. Appalled by their activities, an English military man, Captain William Savage, conceives a hazardous plot to stop them. In disguise, he plans to himself become a “Deceiver” and infiltrate their numbers. Ever present in Savage’s adventures is a sense of dread; he is in constant fear of betrayal and vengeance and also undergoes a disturbing psychological transformation as he experiences the cult’s blood lust firsthand.","releaseInfo":"1988","genres":["Adventure","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.2","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Pierce Brosnan","Shashi Kapoor","Saeed Jaffrey","Helena Michell","Keith Michell","David Robb","Tariq Yunus","Jalal Agha"],"director":["Nicholas Meyer"],"released":"1988-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"How far can a man journey into darkness...and still find his way back?","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Pierce Brosnan","character":"William Savage","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dzXVwwJLPwiZeXOnf7YxorqVEEM.jpg"},{"name":"Shashi Kapoor","character":"Raja Chandra Singh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o18vr1sodUFFRnu7gB7ulZCK1kN.jpg"},{"name":"Saeed Jaffrey","character":"Hussein","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vfESx8h4d8xfGfGasqreTdJgYQP.jpg"},{"name":"Helena Michell","character":"Sarah Wilson"},{"name":"Keith Michell","character":"Colonel Wilson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/96CdOGsJ7JfdOxMm5Jw4jeoWCc3.jpg"},{"name":"David Robb","character":"George Anglesmith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sM4BI80TD4lcVOfxA7UOHO6Wzzx.jpg"},{"name":"T